  "policy": "Explicit renderer identities, not gameplay equivalence or numeric registry/pack IDs. Exact source family, spelling, state and effective flags are required. Unlisted variants remain unknown. Supported horizontal slabs are type bottom/top and waterlogged=false, derived from their observed nonfluid registration and the pinned cell-ID fluid adapter, not a default for arbitrary unknown source families. Contract 3 adds ten exact stairs families with geometry-verified facing/half/corner and dry state, plus Jungle/Cherry lower and upper door roots with fixed right hinge and unknown powered. Source axes are retained with canonical +X east/-Z north naming. Other wood species are not aliased. Contract 4 adds exact Jungle/Cherry logs, barkless logs and planks plus Grass Block. Plain log registrations do not establish a Minecraft axis; Grass Block does not establish snowy. These properties remain unknown, with all reference completions required to agree for pack-ID resolution. No Minecraft default is substituted. Contract 5 adds exact Water and Lava plain roots with non-solid/non-opaque/fluid flags=4. Bloxd static cell behavior is not a Minecraft level producer; level stays unknown over 0..15, with ordered pack-ID consensus and source geometry preserved. No fluid simulation or reference flow/falling data is synthesized.",
